{
  "schema": "muse-workflow-graph/v1",
  "id": "flow-translate-audio-using-ai-ec0135",
  "title": "Translate audio using AI",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "step-1",
      "label": "Model Chat Model",
      "operation": "model",
      "adapter": "model",
      "parameters": {
        "capability": "text generation",
        "settings": {
          "temperature": 0
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "step-2",
      "label": "When clicking \"Execute Workflow\"",
      "operation": "input",
      "adapter": "muse",
      "parameters": {}
    },
    {
      "id": "step-3",
      "label": "Generate French Audio",
      "operation": "http",
      "adapter": "http",
      "parameters": {
        "url": {
          "expression": "https://api.elevenlabs.io/v1/text-to-speech/{{ record.voice_id }}"
        },
        "method": "POST",
        "options": {},
        "jsonBody": {
          "expression": "{\"text\":\"{{ record.text }}\",\"model_id\":\"eleven_multilingual_v2\",\"voice_settings\":{\"stability\":0.5,\"similarity_boost\":0.5}}"
        },
        "sendBody": true,
        "sendQuery": true,
        "sendHeaders": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "queryParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            {
              "name": "optimize_streaming_latency",
              "value": "1"
            }
          ]
        },
        "headerParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            {
              "name": "accept",
              "value": "audio/mpeg"
            }
          ]
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "step-4",
      "label": "Set ElevenLabs voice ID and text",
      "operation": "map-fields",
      "adapter": "local",
      "parameters": {
        "fields": {
          "values": [
            {
              "name": "voice_id",
              "stringValue": "wl7sZxfTOitHVachQiUm"
            },
            {
              "name": "text",
              "stringValue": {
                "expression": "Après, on a fait la sieste, Camille a travaillé pour French Today et j’ai étudié un peu, et puis Camille a proposé de suivre une visite guidée de l’Abbaye de Beauport qui commençait à 17 heures. On a marché environ vingt minutes, et je m’arrêtais souvent pour prendre des photos : la baie de Paimpol est si jolie ! Mais Camille m’a dit : « Dépêche-toi Sunny ! La visite guidée commence dans cinq minutes. » Donc, j’ai bougé mes fesses et on est arrivées à l’abbaye"
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "step-5",
      "label": "Translate Text to English",
      "operation": "generate",
      "adapter": "model",
      "parameters": {
        "prompt": {
          "expression": "Translate to English:\n{{ record.text }}"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "step-6",
      "label": "Translate English text to speech",
      "operation": "http",
      "adapter": "http",
      "parameters": {
        "url": {
          "expression": "https://api.elevenlabs.io/v1/text-to-speech/{{ steps[\"step-4\"].record.voice_id }}"
        },
        "method": "POST",
        "options": {},
        "jsonBody": {
          "expression": "{\"text\":\"{{ record[\"text\"].replaceAll('\"', '\\\\\"').trim() }}\",\"model_id\":\"eleven_multilingual_v2\",\"voice_settings\":{\"stability\":0.5,\"similarity_boost\":0.5}}"
        },
        "sendBody": true,
        "sendQuery": true,
        "sendHeaders": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "queryParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            {
              "name": "optimize_streaming_latency",
              "value": "1"
            }
          ]
        },
        "headerParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            {
              "name": "accept",
              "value": "audio/mpeg"
            }
          ]
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "step-7",
      "label": "Transcribe Audio",
      "operation": "http",
      "adapter": "http",
      "parameters": {
        "url": {
          "configuration_input": "step-7-url"
        },
        "method": "POST",
        "options": {},
        "sendBody": true,
        "contentType": "multipart-form-data",
        "bodyParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            {
              "name": "file",
              "parameterType": "formBinaryData",
              "inputDataFieldName": "data"
            },
            {
              "name": "model",
              "value": "whisper-1"
            }
          ]
        }
      }
    }
  ],
